{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X的感受词和分组明显更密，尤其S08、S11、S12这种短停留段，扫读压力大于Y；Y的左右分栏更容易快速定位。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X用【】把关键心理转折突出出来，人物从不甘、怀念、孤单到逐渐接受两种感情可以并存的过程也交代得更完整，尤其保留了他既舍不得被当作自己人的感觉、又不愿重新忍受委屈的核心矛盾。它的音乐感受不仅有情绪，还具体到音色、动作、空间感和情绪变化，并且部分描述随乐段出现，细腻程度明显胜过Y。Y确实更容易扫读，但部分压缩也削弱了人物动机和情感之间的细微联系，整体上我更愿意选择X。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "5e63e061-0634-4a4f-b559-376cbbf391d8", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T154851281535Z", "elapsed_seconds": 69.562, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T15:50:00.860852+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "65842ad9dbf7c581a2bfb19a86e56aa95245ed7fdbfbc12c69f300142bb2b755", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgp